{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46836","headline":"酬尚颜上人 · 齐己","name":"酬尚颜上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫绶苍髭百岁侵，绿苔芳草遶堦深。\n不妨好鸟喧高卧，切忌闲人聒正吟。\n鲁鼎寂寥休辨口，劫灰销变莫宣心。\n还怜我有冥搜癖，时把新诗过竹寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}